          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinueyi Yehova Nzambi, nyamukaku, wiŋili mweyi mwakunookela, nineyinichimbaŋu chaŋovu yeyi. Eyi Yehova Nzambi, atupristu tweyi ayivwikiwamwinu, akwakujila eyi azaŋalali nayayiwahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.41",
