              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yehova Nzambi, bayi wufutalela weyi awayishawu dehi manjuku; anukaku yaluwi yakambuŋeyi Davidi.",
          "type": "text",
